      "short": "ANT",
      "label": {
        "en": "Anticipation",
        "zh": "預期"
      },
      "definition": {
        "en": "Systematic foresight: exploring plausible futures, handling uncertainty, and keeping design options open before the technology stabilises.",
        "zh": "系統性的前瞻：探索多重可能的未來、處理不確定性，並在技術定型之前保留設計彈性。"
      },
      "labels": {
